\title{cvmdata: Tidy Access to Brazilian CVM Open Data}
\description{
Provides a tidy API to the open data published by the Brazilian Securities and Exchange Commission ('CVM' - Comissao de Valores Mobiliarios) on listed companies: the company register, annual and quarterly financial statements, the reference form, the registration form, the corporate governance code report, insider trading positions, share buyback programmes and the index of periodic filings. Resolves resubmitted filings, returns the original and the restated figures of a fiscal year, applies the currency scale and checks every file against the regulator's data dictionary. Column names, table names, categorical values and free text are preserved in Portuguese as published by 'CVM'; function names, arguments and metadata attributes are in English. By default data is read from a weekly refreshed 'Parquet' mirror maintained by the package author in 'GitHub' Releases, with dated snapshots; the official portal can be read directly instead. The mirror carries data about companies; the tables that describe natural persons are read from the portal.
}
